{"id":"20cb1a93869734ac","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-sentence.md","title":"一阶支撑语言的句子","display":"df-sentence — 一阶支撑语言的句子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-sentence","aliases":["18-df-sentence"],"display":"df-sentence — 一阶支撑语言的句子","depends_on":["[[18-df-formula]]","[[18-df-free-variable]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"4.2 (sentence terminology)","source_printed_pages":"49–50","source_pdf_pages":"59–60","source_correspondence":"supplementary-first-order-interface","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sentence — 一阶支撑语言的句子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.2 (sentence terminology)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"49–50"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"59–60"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"supplementary-first-order-interface"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}\">\\(\\mathrm{free}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a> 的自由变量函数在此一阶公式子集上的限制，变量集同为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一阶补充接口；没有自由变量的公式称句子。原书二阶语境还要求无自由关系变量，不能只检查此处的一个变量集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见 [[18-df-formula]]；$\\mathrm{free}$ 为 [[18-df-free-variable]] 的自由变量函数在此一阶公式子集上的限制，变量集同为 $\\mathrm{Var}_S$。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见 [[18-df-formula]]；$\\mathrm{free}$ 为 [[18-df-free-variable]] 的自由变量函数在此一阶公式子集上的限制，变量集同为 $\\mathrm{Var}_S$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1119,"backlinks":[{"id":"5dd0384f81f0e316","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L=\\{\\in,=\\}\\cup C$ 是纯集合论语言加常元集 $C$；$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}$ 是给定句子公理集。$\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}$ 为 [[./18-df-sentence]] 的句子集，公式语法见 [[./18-df-formula]]。"},{"id":"ad4722aacf87aee1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ 与 $\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}$ 见 [[18-df-provable]]；$\\bot\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 是固定矛盾句，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 是理论参数；句子见 [[18-df-sentence]]。"},{"id":"98c11a88e50650e8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I_{\\varepsilon_0}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 是给定的、沿原书递归记号系统表达的对象归纳公理集；$C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 是给定一致性对象句。句子接口见 [[18-df-sentence]]。"},{"id":"b90047664466f5b8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$、$\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}$ 见 [[18-df-provable]]，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；$\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ 见 [[18-df-sentence]]。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-sentence]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-sentence]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-sentence|18-df-sentence]]"}],"outgoing":["2718a8a11c38